kedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T18:29:16-07:00","id":948227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>2ptTakrill</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/947546-darkly-depraved-disney-the-magic-kingdom-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=948224#post948224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A dark reflection of Disneyland exists (in Shadow, a Pandemonium emanation realm, etc...), the actual Dark Kingdom that WAS created, an empty park where the villains and monsters of the fantasy tales are all to real and occasionally visitors or workers who leave the Magic Kingdom find themselves alone here instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's actually a book series about this. I think it's called <i>Kingdom Keepers</i>.<br /> <br /> (I'm from Florida, and I used to work for Disney, and I'm kind of obsessed.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T18:37:37-07:00","id":948231,"title":"","content":"Club 33 at Disneyland is a open secret, a private VIP lounge for the corporate elite. Thing is, Disney World has Club 55, which is where the supernatural elite gather at the park. The club is a strictly enforced neutral ground in supernatural politics, with Disney corp sec High Threat Response teams on stand by at all times. The stories of the debauchery that takes place here have become origin stories for many tropes and in-jokes in the supernatural community. For example, the phrase &quot;fish malk&quot; to describe a malkavia infected vampire who acts in a wacky manner is said to have began with an incident in which a Ventrue member with latent malkavia was activated somehow and then proceeded to pick up one of the catfish that were about to fried for the guest and slapped Max Roman in the face with it,causing a food fight that took weeks to clean up. Another popular rumor centered on the 55 club is that the mess in Florida during the 2000 election was planned here by a cabal of techno geek and media industry connected supernaturals who absolutely did not want Tipper Gore and Joe Lieberman as the first lady and vice president due to their pro censorship positions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T19:03:54-07:00","id":948257,"title":"","content":"The other thing is that Disney world gangs exist, including a cult of crazy Russians that worship Gadget from the rescue rangers. those Russians are obviously a pack of Iron Masters who are part of the park security, and Gadget is indeed their totem. There is also a pack of transmale storm lords who worship Chip and Dale themselves, since I am sure you have all heard that fan theory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T19:33:06-07:00","id":948274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>2ptTakrill</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/947546-darkly-depraved-disney-the-magic-kingdom-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=948224#post948224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A dark reflection of Disneyland exists (in Shadow, a Pandemonium emanation realm, etc...), the actual Dark Kingdom that WAS created, an empty park where the villains and monsters of the fantasy tales are all to real and occasionally visitors or workers who leave the Magic Kingdom find themselves alone here instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>Holy shit, I realized that something like the &quot;dark kingdom&quot; would be an amazing Arcadian Domain. Not as in literally a canceled Disney park existing in Arcadia, but the basic premise of &quot;what if the fairytale villains won&quot; applied to a realm, which for added style looks like a giant but sinister amusement park. <br /> <br /> You could get plenty of interesting Durances out of it too. The villains always need minions, prot\u00e9g\u00e9s, and heroes to triumph over, after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T19:41:20-07:00","id":948283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/947546-darkly-depraved-disney-the-magic-kingdom-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=948194#post948194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Abandoned by Disney, Abandoned by God.<br /> <br /> Just saying.</div> </div> </div> </div>I looked that up. Holy $%*# was that creepy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T19:45:34-07:00","id":948287,"title":"","content":"I'm not gonna deny that that was the main thing that influenced me on to make this thread. <br /> <br /> I mean, I've always found Disney vaguely menacing and I've always loved &quot;weird Florida&quot; stuff, but ABD basically kicked off the &quot;Disney creepypasta&quot; boom.<br /> <br /> It also has an excellent lesson for people who want to write &quot;this really happened!&quot; fake-blog-post format horror: deliberate use of typos and grammatical and formatting mistakes is a vastly underappreciated tool. Traumatized urban explorers rarely type like horror writers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 08-10-2016, 10:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.the