ney-the-magic-kingdom-in-the-world-of-darkness?p=948760#post948760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Corruptus is pretty much what takes the whole of the Abandoned by Disney series and turns it into a Promethean story, with Disney basically being overloaded with Extempore.<br /> <br /> I actually kind of don't like that, and much prefer to view most of it through ghost story lenses(see my comment of playing Room Zero's Gascot someday), but that's what's happening.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know, I found the prequel with the suggestion box to be more that, really. But we can interpret them differently, I'm fine with that =). <br /> <br /> My question stands for Geckopirateship, as I always like reading Disney horror--are you talking about one of the stories we've discussed, or are you specifically talking about a story called &quot;Disney's Animatronics&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T12:55:59-07:00","id":948778,"title":"","content":"Suggestion: I wasn't going to say anything because I'm pretty tolerant, but please stop admitting children without faces. They won't stay in the guest areas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","d